#: app/kateexternaltools.cpp:427
msgid "Edit External Tool"
msgstr "Tışqı Qoral Üzgärtü"

#: app/kateexternaltools.cpp:441
msgid "&Label:"
msgstr "&Yazma:"

#: app/kateexternaltools.cpp:446
msgid "The name will be displayed in the 'Tools->External' menu"
msgstr "İsem 'Qorallar->Tışqı' saylağında kürsäteläçäk."

#: app/kateexternaltools.cpp:456
msgid "S&cript:"
msgstr "Ämerle&k:"

#: app/kateexternaltools.cpp:461
msgid ""
"<p>The script to execute to invoke the tool. The script is passed to /bin/sh "
"for execution. The following macros will be expanded:</p>"
"<ul>"
"<li><code>%URL</code> - the URL of the current document."
"<li><code>%URLs</code> - a list of the URLs of all open documents."
"<li><code>%directory</code> - the URL of the directory containing the current "
"document."
"<li><code>%filename</code> - the filename of the current document."
"<li><code>%line</code> - the current line of the text cursor in the current "
"view."
"<li><code>%column</code> - the column of the text cursor in the current view."
"<li><code>%selection</code> - the selected text in the current view."
"<li><code>%text</code> - the text of the current document.</ul>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Qoral faydalanuın başqarğan skript. Skript başqarılu öçen /bin/sh 'ğa "
"cibärelde. Bu makros kiñäyteläçäk:</p>"
"<ul>"
"<li><code>%URL</code> - xäzerge dokumentnıñ URL'ı."
"<li><code>%URLs</code> - barlıq açıq dokumentlarnıñ URL tezmäse."
"<li><code>%directory</code> - xäzerge dokumentnı üzenä alğan törgäk URL'ı."
"<li><code>%filename</code> - xäzerge dokumentnıñ birem iseme."
"<li><code>%line</code> - xäzerge küreneştä kursor bulğan yulnıñ sanı."
"<li><code>%column</code> - xäzerge küreneştä kursor bulğan bağananıñ sanı."
"<li><code>%selection</code> - xäzerge küreneştä saylanğan tekst."
"<li><code>%text</code> - xäzerge dokumentnıñ tekstı.</ul>"

#: app/kateexternaltools.cpp:479
msgid "&Executable:"
msgstr "&Eşçän:"

#: app/kateexternaltools.cpp:484
msgid ""
"The executable used by the command. This is used to check if a tool should be "
"displayed; if not set, the first word of <em>command</em> will be used."
msgstr ""
"Bu boyırıq qullanğan eşçän. Qoralnıñ kürsäteläçägen tikşerer öçen qullanıla. "
"Quyılğan bulmasa, <em>boyırıq</em>'nıñ berençe süze qullanılaçaq"

#: app/kateexternaltools.cpp:490
msgid "&Mime types:"
msgstr "&MIME töre:"

#: app/kateexternaltools.cpp:495
msgid ""
"A semicolon-separated list of mime types for which this tool should be "
"available; if this is left empty, the tool is always available. To choose from "
"known mimetypes, press the button on the right."
msgstr ""
"Noqtalı öter aşa yazılğan bu quralnı qullana alğan mime törlär tezmäse. Buş "
"qalsa, qoral härwaqıt qullanırlıq bulır. Bilgele mime törlärdan saylar öçen, "
"uñdağı töymägä bas."

#: app/kateexternaltools.cpp:504
msgid "Click for a dialog that can help you creating a list of mimetypes."
msgstr "Mime törlär tezmäsen yasarğa bulışa alğan dialog açar öçen monda bas."

