msgstr "<p>Sözgeçlär quş qırınıñ taríxında niçä sözgeç saqlanuın xäl itä."

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:595
msgid ""
"<p>These options allow you to have the File Selector automatically change "
"location to the folder of the active document on certain events."
"<p>Auto synchronization is <em>lazy</em>, meaning it will not take effect until "
"the file selector is visible."
"<p>None of these are enabled by default, but you can always sync the location "
"by pressing the sync button in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"<p>Bu saylanma Birem Saylawçını urınnı automat räweştä aktif istälek yä ki "
"bilgele waqíğalar törgägenä alıştırırğa mömkinlek birä."
"<p> Auto işläw (sinxronlaw)<em>yalqaw</em>dır, yäğni Birem Saylawçınıñ "
"kürenerlek xälgä kilgänenä birle ul başlanmayaçaq."
"<p>Bolarnıñ berse dä bar bulğan kileş açıq tügel, läkin sin härwaqıt qoral "
"taqtasında işläw sädäfen basıp, urınnı işli alasıñ."

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:604
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is enabled (default), the location will be restored when you "
"start Kate."
"<p><strong>Note</strong> that if the session is handled by the KDE session "
"manager, the location is always restored."
msgstr ""
"<p>Bu saylanma açıq bulsa (bar bulğan), Kate başlağan waqıtta urın iske xälenä "
"qaytarılaçaq. "
"<p>Sessia KDE sessia citäkçese tarafınnan totılsa, urın härwaqıt iske xälenä "
"qaytarılaçağın<strong>istä tot</strong>"

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:608
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is enabled (default), the current filter will be restored "
"when you start Kate."
"<p><strong>Note</strong> that if the session is handled by the KDE session "
"manager, the filter is always restored."
"<p><strong>Note</strong> that some of the autosync settings may override the "
"restored location if on."
msgstr ""
"<p>Bu saylanma açıq bulsa (bar bulğan), Kate başlağanda xäzerge sözgeç "
"elekkegesenä almaşınaçaq."
"<p>Sessia KDE sessia citäkçese tarafınnan totılsa, sözgeç härwaqıt iske xälenä "
"qaytarılaçağın<strong>istä tot</strong>. Qayber auto işläw köylämäläre dä "
"elekkege xällärenä qayta aluın <strong>istä tot</strong>."

