#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<p>Kate comes with a nice set of plugins, providing simple\n"
"and advanced features of all sorts.</p>\n"
"<p>You can enable/disable plugins to suit your needs in the configuration "
"dialog,\n"
"choose <strong>Settings -&gt;configure</strong> to launch that.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kate yaxşı pluginnar cíılması belän kilä,\n"
"qullanuçığa ğädi häm alğarışlı mömkinleklär täqdim itä.</p>\n"
"<p>Íxtíaclarıña caylattırıp, pluginnarnı sälätle/sälätsez yasarğa mömkin, anıñ "
"öçen tärtipkä salu dialogında <strong>Köylämälär -&gt;tärtipkä sal</strong> "
"saylísı.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:11
msgid ""
"<p>You can swap the characters on each side of the cursor just by pressing\n"
"<strong>Ctrl+T</strong></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kursornıñ ike yağındağı bilgeneñ urının\n"
" <strong>Ctrl+T</strong> basıp alıştırırğa bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:17
msgid ""
"<p>You can export the current document as a HTML file, including\n"
"syntax highlighting.</p>\n"
"<p>Just choose <strong>File -&gt; Export -&gt; HTML...</strong></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Xäzerge dokumentnı sintaksis yaqtırtuı saqlanğan HTML-birem kileş çığara "
"alasıñ.</p>\n"
"<p>Anıñ öçen <strong>Birem -&gt; HTML...<strong> sayla</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:24
msgid ""
"<p>You can split the Kate editor as many times as you like and\n"
"in either direction. Each frame has its own status bar and\n"
"can display any open document.</p>\n"
"<p>Just choose "
"<br><strong>View -&gt; Split [ Horizontal | Vertical ]</strong></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kate möxärriren telägän qädär märtäbä yara\n"
" häm berläşterä alasıñ. Här qısanıñ üz xäl taqtası häm\n"
"härberse härber açıq dokumentnı kürsätä ala.</p>\n"
"<p>Anıñ öçen"
"<br><strong>Küreneş -&gt; Yar [Yatma | Asma ]</strong> saylísı</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:32
msgid ""
"<p>You can drag the Tool views (<em>File List</em> and <em>File Selector</em>)\n"
"to any side that you want them in Kate, or stack them, or even tear them off "
"the\n"
"main window.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Bu qorallar tiräsen (<em>Birem Tezmäse</em> belän <em>Birem Saylağıç</em>)\n"
"Kate eçendä bulğan berär yanına da küçerep bula, ber-ber artlı da quyıp bula, "
"töp täräzädän dä ayırıp bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:39
msgid ""
"<p>Kate has a built-in terminal emulator, just click on <strong>"
"\"Terminal\"</strong> at\n"
"the bottom to show or hide it as you desire.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kate'nıñ eçke terminal emulatorı bar. Anı yäşerer yä ki kürsäter öçen\n"
"astağı <strong>\"Terminal\"</strong>'ğa bas.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:45
msgid ""
"<p>Kate can highlight the current line with a\n"
"<table bgcolor=\"yellow\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" "
"width=\"100%\">"
"<tr>"
"<td>different\n"
"background color.<strong>|</strong></td></tr></table></p>\n"
"<p>You can set the color in the <em>Colors</em> page of the configuration\n"
"dialog.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kate xäzerge yulnı<table bgcolor=\"yellow\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" "
"cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\">"
"<tr>"
"<td>different\n"
"arqa plan töse belän yaqtırta ala.<strong>|</strong></td></tr></table></p>\n"
"<p>Tösne Tärtipkä salu'nıñ <em>Tözlär</em> bitendä\n"
"bilgelärgä bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:54
msgid ""
"<p>You can open the currently edited file in any other application from within\n"
"Kate.</p>\n"
"<p>Choose <strong>File -&gt; Open With</strong> for the list of programs\n"
"configured\n"
"for the document type. There is also an option <strong>Other...</strong> to\n"
"choose any application on your system.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Xäzer üzgärtelgän biremne Kate eçendäge teläsä qaysı eşçändä\n"
"açarğa mömkin.</p>\n"
"<p>İstälek töre öçen tezelgän yazılımnar tezmäsen açar öçen\n"
"<strong>Birem -&gt; belän Aç</strong> sayla.\n"
" Sistemıñdağı bulğan başqa başqarmalar saylaw öçen\n"
"tağın <strong>Başqa...</strong> saylaw mömkin.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:64
msgid ""
"<p>You can configure the editor to always display the line numbers and/or\n"
"bookmark panes when started from the <strong>View Defaults</strong> "
"page of the\n"
"configuration dialog.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Tärtipkä salu dialogınıñ <strong>Bar bulğan</strong> "
"bitennän başlağan çaqta möxärrirne härwaqıt yul sannarın häm/yä ki bitbilge "
"taqtasın kürsätäçäk itep köyli alasıñ.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:71
msgid ""
"<p>You can download new or updated <em>Syntax highlight definitions</em> from\n"
"the <strong>Highlighting</strong> page in the configuration dialog.</p>\n"
"<p>Just click the <em>Download...</em> button on the <em>Highlight Modes</em>\n"
"tab (You have to be online, of course...).</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Tärtipkä salu dialogınıñ <strong>Yaqtırtu</strong> bitennän\n"
"yaña yä ki yañartılğan <em> Sintaksis yaqtırtu törlären</em> iñderä alasıñ.</p>"
"\n"
"<p>Anıñ öçen, päräwezgä totaşqaçtın,\n"
"<em>Yaqtırtu Isulları</em> bitendä <em>İñder</em> bas.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:79
msgid ""
"<p>You can cycle through all open documents by pressing <strong>"
"Alt+Left</strong>\n"
"or <strong>Alt+Right</strong>. The next/previous document will immediately be "
"displayed\n"
"in the active frame.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> Açıq dokumentlar buyınça sikerer öçen\n"
"<strong>Alt+Sulğa</strong> yä ki <strong>Alt+Uñğa</strong> basası.\n"
"Kiläse/uzğan istälek şunduq aktif qısada kürenäçäk.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:86
msgid ""
"<p>You can do cool sed-like regular expression replacements using <em>"
"Command Line</em>.</p>\n"
"<p>For example, press <strong>F7</strong> and enter <code>"
"s /oldtext/newtext/g</code>\n"
"to replace &quot;oldtext&quot; with &quot;newtext&quot; throughout the current\n"
"line.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><em>Ämer yulı</em> belän sed kebek regular ekspressia almaştıruların qılırğa "
"mömkin.</p>\n"
"<p>Mäsälän, xäzerge yulda oçrağan barlıq &quot;isketekst&quot;'larnı "
"&quot;yañatekstt&quot;'lar belän alıştırır öçen\n"
"<strong>F7</strong> basıp <code>s /isketekst/yañatekst/g</code> cí\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:94
msgid ""
"<p>You can repeat your last search by just pressing <strong>F3</strong>, or\n"
"<strong>Shift+F3</strong> if you want to search backwards.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Soñğı ezläwne qabatlar öçen <strong>F3</strong>, yä ki,\n"
"kire yünäleştä ezlärgä teläsäñ, <strong>Shift+F3</strong> basası ğına</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:100
msgid ""
"<p>You can filter the files displayed in the <em>File Selector</em> tool view.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Simply enter your filter in the filter entry at the bottom, for example:\n"
"<code>*.html *.php</code> if you only want to see HTML and PHP files in the\n"
"current folder.</p>\n"
"<p>The File Selector will even remember your filters for you.</strong></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><em>Birem Saylawçı</em> qoralında kürengän fayllarnı sözärgä mömkin.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Anıñ öçen astağı sözgeç keremendä sözgeçeñne bilgelä, mäsälän:\n"
"Xäzerge törgäktäge HTML häm PHP faylların ğına kürer öçen <code>"
"*.html *.php</code> cí.</p>\n"
"<p>Birem Saylawçı sineñ öçen xättä sineñ öçen sözgeçläreñne istä totar.</strong>"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:110
msgid ""
"<p>You can have two views - or even more - of the same document in Kate. "
"Editing\n"
"in either will be reflected in both.</p>\n"
"<p>So if you find yourself scrolling up and down to look at text at the other\n"
"end of a document, just press <strong>Ctrl+Shift+T</strong> to split\n"
"horizontally.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ber ük dokumentnñ Kate'da ike häm artığraq küreneşe bula ala.\n"
"Här ikesendä yasalğan üzgäreşlär ikesendä dä kürsäteläçäk.</p>\n"
"<p>Şulay itep, dokumentnıñ ike başında texnı qarawdan arğan bulsañ,\n"
"täräzäne arqılıdan yarır öçen <strong>Ctrl+Shift+T</strong> basası ğına.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:119
msgid ""
"<p>Press <strong>F8</strong> or <strong>Shift+F8</strong> to switch to the\n"
"next/previous frame.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kiläse/ütkän qısağa küçär öçen <strong>F8</strong> yä ki <strong>"
"Shift+F8</strong> bas.</p>\n"

